exports[`output baseline: proxy denial bodies > every denial reason renders a stable body 1`] = `
{
  "connect-host-mismatch": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: the request host does not match the admitted CONNECT host

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "connect-sni-mismatch": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: TLS SNI does not match the admitted CONNECT host

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "git-push-denied": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  method: POST
  path:   /api/v1/things
  reason: git push is denied for this host

This host's policy denies git pushes. The person operating Runfree can
review or replace the rule on the host machine:

  runfree host rules api.example.com

Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
  "host-not-allowlisted": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: host is not in the project network allowlist

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
If this host should be reachable, the person operating Runfree can run
on the host machine:

  runfree host add api.example.com

Policy reloads automatically; rerun the failed command afterwards.
",
  "malformed-connect": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: malformed CONNECT request

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "method-not-allowed": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  method: POST
  reason: method is not permitted for this host (allowed: GET, HEAD)

The person operating Runfree can widen this on the host machine:

  runfree host rules api.example.com --method GET --method HEAD --method POST --request-path-prefix /api/ --deny-git-push --write ask

This replaces the host's request rule with: methods=GET,HEAD,POST pathPrefixes=/api/ gitPush=deny writeAction=ask

Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
  "missing-admission-record": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: the connection did not pass the Runfree CONNECT admission boundary

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
This connection was denied when it was opened and cannot be upgraded in
place, even if the host has since been allowed. Retry on a new connection:
rerun the failed command; a client that pools connections must reconnect.

Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
  "missing-required-token": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: a required proxy-managed token is not configured for this host

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "non-https-port": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: CONNECT to a non-HTTPS port is not allowed

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "non-https-url": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: only HTTPS outbound requests are allowed

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "non-wss-url": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: only WSS (secure WebSocket) outbound requests are allowed

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "path-not-allowed": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  method: POST
  path:   /api/v1/things
  reason: path is not permitted for this host (allowed prefixes: /api/)

The person operating Runfree can widen this on the host machine:

  runfree host rules api.example.com --method GET --method HEAD --request-path-prefix /api/ --request-path-prefix <prefix> --deny-git-push --write ask

This replaces the host's request rule with: methods=GET,HEAD pathPrefixes=/api/,<prefix> gitPush=deny writeAction=ask

Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
  "policy-denied": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: blocked by proxy policy

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "proxy-authorization-not-allowed": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: the proxy never accepts Proxy-Authorization from the agent

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "request-head-timeout": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: the request head was not completed before the proxy's timeout

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "request-head-too-large": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: the request head exceeds the proxy's size limit

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "unregistered-session-peer": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: the source peer has no active Runfree session admission

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "unsupported-client-protocol": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: the proxy only accepts HTTP/1.1 proxy requests on this port

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
The person operating Runfree can inspect recent denials by running
\`runfree doctor\` on the host machine.
",
  "websocket-host-not-allowlisted": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  reason: websocket host is not in the project network allowlist

This block is enforced by the Runfree proxy outside the agent container.
If this host should be reachable, the person operating Runfree can run
on the host machine:

  runfree host add api.example.com

Policy reloads automatically; rerun the failed command afterwards.
",
  "write-approval-capacity": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  method: POST
  path:   /api/v1/things
  reason: too many writes already waiting for approval

The person operating Runfree can decide the pending approvals with
\`runfree approvals\`, then retry the request.
Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
  "write-approval-required": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  method: POST
  path:   /api/v1/things
  reason: writes need approval but no approver is attached

Writes to this host need a human approval, and no approver is attached.
The person operating Runfree can attach an approver on the host machine:

  runfree approvals --watch

or allow writes to this host in project policy:

  runfree host rules api.example.com --write allow

Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
  "write-approval-session-denied": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  method: POST
  path:   /api/v1/things
  reason: the operator denied writes for this session until they clear the deny

Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
  "write-approval-timeout": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  method: POST
  path:   /api/v1/things
  reason: held for approval — no response before the hold timed out

This write was held for approval and denied when nobody responded.
The person operating Runfree can approve the next attempt:

  runfree approvals

then retry the request.
Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
  "write-denied": "Runfree blocked this request.

  host:   api.example.com
  method: POST
  path:   /api/v1/things
  reason: writes to this host are blocked (read-only)

This host's policy blocks writes. The person operating Runfree can
switch writes to ask-for-approval on the host machine:

  runfree host rules api.example.com --write ask

Current rules: runfree host explain api.example.com
",
}
`;

